# rpmlint filter list, passed explicitly via `rpmlint -r ci/rpmlintrc`.
#
# Kept in ci/ (not the repo root, not named *rpmlintrc there) so rpmlint does
# NOT auto-discover it: an auto-loaded filter that matches nothing during a
# bare `rpmlint foo.spec` run is itself reported as an error.
#
# Only dictionary false positives are filtered: "framebuffer", "systemd" and
# "buffyboard" are correct, deliberate technical terms in the descriptions.

addFilter(r"spelling-error .*'(framebuffer|systemd|buffyboard)'")
